{
  "name": "ListOpsSynthesisTasks",
  "summary": "查询评测集合成任务列表",
  "tags": "评测集管理",
  "productshort": "AgentArts",
  "region_id": "cn-east-4",
  "paths": {
    "/v1/ops/datasets-synthesis": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Dataset"
        ],
        "summary": "查询评测集合成任务列表",
        "description": "该接口用于分页查询当前租户下所有已提交的评测集合成异步任务,支持按任务名称、状态等多种过滤条件进行检索,提供任务执行进度。\n适用场景:\n- 任务进度查看:在发起大规模数据合成后,通过此接口批量获取任务的运行状态(如:进行中、已完成、已失败)。\n- 历史合成记录管理:复盘并管理过往提交的数据生成任务,审计合成任务的执行频率与成功率。",
        "operationId": "ListOpsSynthesisTasks",
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "status",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n任务状态过滤条件。用于筛选处于特定生命周期阶段的合成任务。\n**约束限制:**\n不涉及。\n**取值范围:**\n- `pending`: 等待中\n- `running`: 运行中\n- `completed`: 已完成\n- `failed`: 失败\n- `stopped`: 已停止\n**默认取值:**\n不涉及。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "pending",
              "running",
              "completed",
              "failed",
              "stopped"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "name",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n任务名称检索字段。支持根据创建任务时自定义的名称进行筛选。\n**约束限制:**\n支持模糊匹配,字符串长度限制为0到100个字符。\n**取值范围:**\n0到100字符。\n**默认取值:**\n不涉及。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 100,
            "minLength": 0
          },
          {
            "name": "offset",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n分页查询的起始偏移量。用于指定从满足条件的第几条记录开始返回,常与 limit参数配合实现分页功能。\n**约束限制:**\n必须为整数,且大小在0到10,000之间。\n**取值范围:**\n0-10000。\n**默认取值:**\n0。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "integer",
            "default": 0,
            "maximum": 10000,
            "minimum": 0
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n单次查询返回的最大记录数量。用于控制分页查询时每页显示的数据条数。\n**约束限制:**\n必须为整数,且大小在1到100之间。\n**取值范围:**\n1-100。\n**默认取值:**\n10。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "integer",
            "default": 10,
            "maximum": 100,
            "minimum": 1
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "查询成功",
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "syntheses": [
                  {
                    "id": "task_uuid",
                    "name": "task_uuid",
                    "scenario_type": "seed_data",
                    "scenario_name": "基于种子数据泛化",
                    "scenario_description": "基于现有100条React问答,生成50条更复杂的面试题",
                    "status": "running",
                    "progress": 65,
                    "sample_count": 50,
                    "generated_count": 33,
                    "model_config": {
                      "model_id": "1749615103",
                      "model_name": "豆包·1.6·自动深度思考",
                      "temperature": 0.1,
                      "max_tokens": 4096,
                      "top_p": 0.7,
                      "frequency_penalty": 0
                    },
                    "seed_data": {
                      "type": "dataset",
                      "dataset_id": "c3c2571d-a8b0-4447-8b79-a67cac076768",
                      "dataset_name": "种子评测集名称",
                      "dataset_version_id": "c3c2571d-a8b0-4447-8b79-a67cac076768",
                      "dataset_version": "0.0.1",
                      "file_name": "seed.jsonl",
                      "obs_tmp_file_id": "obs:../path/to/seed.jsonl"
                    },
                    "base_info": {
                      "created_at": "2026-02-27T03:09:53.799Z",
                      "start_at": "2026-02-27T03:09:53.799Z",
                      "updated_at": "2026-02-27T03:09:53.799Z",
                      "completed_at": "2026-02-27T03:09:53.799Z",
                      "duration_seconds": 325,
                      "created_by": {
                        "name": "op_svc_modelartsversatile_container0",
                        "user_id": "6f80301edacc43728bf47b6a6484d512"
                      },
                      "started_by": {
                        "name": "op_svc_modelartsversatile_container0",
                        "user_id": "6f80301edacc43728bf47b6a6484d512"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "total": 10
              }
            },
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ListOpsSynthesisTasksResponseBody"
            }
          }
        },
        "x-request-examples-url-1": "GET https://*.com/agentarts/v1/ops/datasets-synthesis",
        "x-request-examples-text-1": "",
        "x-request-examples-1": "",
        "x-api-framework": "RestfulAPI",
        "x-api-user": "IAM普通租户",
        "x-open-api": true,
        "x-api-type": "open-api",
        "x-is-registered": "Y",
        "x-support-sdk": "Y",
        "x-api-service-plane": "Management-plane",
        "x-sec-data-level": "L4"
      }
    }
  },
  "definitions": {
    "EvaluationOpsTaskBaseInfo": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "created_at": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "2026-02-27T03:09:53.799Z",
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n任务在系统中创建的时间戳。\n**取值范围:**\n日期时间字符串。",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 64
        },
        "start_at": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "2026-02-27T03:09:53.799Z",
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n任务正式开始执行的精确时刻。\n**取值范围:**\n日期时间字符串。",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 64
        },
        "updated_at": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "2026-02-27T03:09:53.799Z",
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n任务状态或元数据最后一次变更的时间。\n**取值范围:**\n日期时间字符串。",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 64
        },
        "completed_at": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "2026-02-27T03:09:53.799Z",
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n任务执行完毕(无论成败)的时间。\n**取值范围:**\n日期时间字符串。",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 64
        },
        "duration_seconds": {
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int64",
          "example": 325,
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n任务的有效运行总时长(秒)。\n**取值范围:**\n非负整数。",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 31536000
        },
        "created_by": {
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n创建该任务的用户详细信息。\n**取值范围:**\n参考UserInfoObj。",
          "$ref": "#/definitions/UserInfoObj"
        },
        "started_by": {
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n启动该任务的用户详细信息。\n**取值范围:**\n参考UserInfoObj。",
          "$ref": "#/definitions/UserInfoObj"
        }
      }
    },
    "ListOpsSynthesisTasksResponseBody": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "syntheses": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n包含合成任务摘要信息的对象列表。\n**取值范围:**  \n参考EvaluationOpsSynthesisTaskSummary定义。",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/EvaluationOpsSynthesisTaskSummary"
          },
          "maxItems": 10000,
          "minItems": 0
        },
        "total": {
          "type": "integer",
          "example": 10,
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n符合当前筛选条件的任务总记录数。\n**取值范围:**  \n0-500。",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 500
        }
      }
    },
    "UserInfoObj": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "op_svc_modelartsversatile_container0",
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n用户的显示名称。\n**取值范围:**\n任意字符串。",
          "minLength": 0,
          "maxLength": 1200
        },
        "user_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "6f80301edacc43728bf47b6a6484d512",
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n用户在账号系统中的唯一身份ID。\n**取值范围:**\n不涉及",
          "minLength": 0,
          "maxLength": 1200
        }
      }
    },
    "EvaluationOpsSeedDataConfig": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "seed_data_type"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "type": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "dataset",
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n种子数据的来源类型。\n**取值范围:**  \ndataset(评测集),file(文件)。",
          "enum": [
            "dataset",
            "file"
          ]
        },
        "dataset_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "c3c2571d-a8b0-4447-8b79-a67cac076768",
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n种子评测集的唯一ID。\n**取值范围:**  \n符合通用唯一识别码(UUID)标准的字符串。",
          "minLength": 0,
          "maxLength": 64
        },
        "dataset_name": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "种子评测集名称",
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n种子评测集的展示名称。\n**取值范围:**  \n任意字符串。",
          "minLength": 0,
          "maxLength": 200
        },
        "dataset_version_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "c3c2571d-a8b0-4447-8b79-a67cac076768",
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n种子评测集版本的内部唯一标识符。\n**取值范围:**  \n符合通用唯一识别码(UUID)标准的字符串。",
          "minLength": 0,
          "maxLength": 64
        },
        "dataset_version": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "0.0.1",
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n种子评测集的可读版本号。\n**取值范围:**  \n如0.0.1。",
          "minLength": 0,
          "maxLength": 64
        },
        "file_name": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "seed.jsonl",
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n作为种子源的临时文件名称。\n**取值范围:**  \n文件名。",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 200
        },
        "obs_tmp_file_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "obs:../path/to/seed.jsonl",
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n种子数据文件在对象存储中的路径。\n**取值范围:**  \nOBS路径。",
          "minLength": 0,
          "maxLength": 10000
        }
      }
    },
    "EvaluationOpsModelConfig": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "model_id",
        "model_name"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "model_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "1749615103",
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n指定调用的大模型唯一标识符,通过模型列表接口获取。",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 64
        },
        "model_name": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "豆包·1.6·自动深度思考",
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n模型的显示名称。\n**取值范围:**  \n任意字符串。",
          "minLength": 2,
          "maxLength": 100
        },
        "temperature": {
          "type": "number",
          "format": "float",
          "example": 0.1,
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n采样温度参数,用于控制输出的随机性。数值低更聚焦,数值高更具创造性。\n**取值范围:**  \n0.0到2.0。",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 2,
          "default": 0.7
        },
        "max_tokens": {
          "type": "integer",
          "example": 4096,
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n单次推理生成的最大Token数量限制。\n**取值范围:**  \n1-32000。",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 32000
        },
        "top_p": {
          "type": "number",
          "format": "float",
          "example": 0.7,
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n核采样参数。\n**取值范围:**  \n0.0到1.0。",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 1,
          "default": 1.0
        },
        "frequency_penalty": {
          "type": "number",
          "format": "float",
          "example": 0.0,
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n频率惩罚系数,降低内容重复倾向。\n**取值范围:**  \n-2.0到2.0。",
          "minimum": -2.0,
          "maximum": 2.0,
          "default": 0.0
        }
      }
    },
    "EvaluationOpsSynthesisTaskSummary": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "task_uuid",
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n合成任务的唯一标识符。\n**约束限制:**  \n1-64 字符。\n**取值范围:**  \nUUID或系统生成的ID。\n**默认取值:**  \n不涉及。",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 64
        },
        "name": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "task_uuid",
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n用户为合成任务定义的名称。\n**约束限制:**  \n1-100字符。\n**取值范围:**  \n任意字符串。\n**默认取值:**  \n不涉及。",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 100
        },
        "scenario_type": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "seed_data",
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n合成任务的技术场景类型。\n**约束限制:**  \n枚举值。\n**取值范围:**  \nseed_data等。\n**默认取值:**  \n不涉及。",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 64
        },
        "scenario_name": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "基于种子数据泛化",
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n场景的友好展示名称。\n**约束限制:**\n1-4000字符。\n**取值范围:**\n如 \"基于种子数据泛化\"。\n**默认取值:**\n不涉及。",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 4000
        },
        "scenario_description": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "基于现有100条React问答,生成50条更复杂的面试题",
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n合成任务背景的详细描述。\n**约束限制:**  \n1-4000字符。\n**取值范围:**  \n场景背景文本。\n**默认取值:**  \n不涉及。",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 4000
        },
        "status": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "running",
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n合成任务当前的生命周期状态。\n**约束限制:**  \n枚举类型。\n**取值范围:**  \npending, running, completed, failed, stopped。\n**默认取值:**  \npending。",
          "enum": [
            "pending",
            "running",
            "completed",
            "failed",
            "stopped"
          ]
        },
        "progress": {
          "type": "integer",
          "example": 65,
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n当前合成进度百分比。\n**约束限制:**  \n0-100 整数。\n**取值范围:**  \n0-100。\n**默认取值:**  \n0。",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 100
        },
        "sample_count": {
          "type": "integer",
          "example": 50,
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n预设需要生成的总样本数量。\n**约束限制:**  \n1-500整数。\n**取值范围:**  \n1-500。\n**默认取值:**  \n1。",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 500
        },
        "generated_count": {
          "type": "integer",
          "example": 33,
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n截至当前已生成的有效样本数。\n**约束限制:**  \n不大于sample_count。\n**取值范围:**  \n0-500。\n**默认取值:**  \n0。",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 500
        },
        "model_config": {
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n任务使用的模型配置。\n**约束限制:**  \n参考EvaluationOpsModelConfig。\n**取值范围:**  \n不涉及。\n**默认取值:**  \n不涉及。",
          "$ref": "#/definitions/EvaluationOpsModelConfig"
        },
        "seed_data": {
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n任务使用的种子数据配置。\n**约束限制:**  \n参考EvaluationOpsSeedDataConfig。\n**取值范围:**  \n不涉及。\n**默认取值:**  \n不涉及。",
          "$ref": "#/definitions/EvaluationOpsSeedDataConfig"
        },
        "base_info": {
          "description": "**参数解释:**  \n任务基础元数据。\n**约束限制:**  \n参考EvaluationOpsTaskBaseInfo。\n**取值范围:**  \n不涉及。\n**默认取值:**  \n不涉及。",
          "$ref": "#/definitions/EvaluationOpsTaskBaseInfo"
        }
      }
    }
  },
